# The picture of ai.md: the AI settings of the preferences screen. The
# Script menu's Allow AI Connections and the confirmation dialog are not
# drawn on the headless platform, so the page gives them in words.
menu Edit|Preferences...
size tw 680 214
# Scrolled down to the settings for AI programs.
twscroll 300 100 -12.3
mark 12 80 620 70 tw
shot ai-1-preferences tw
